5. WHY THE HARDWARE DEPENDENCY HAD TO GO RATHER THAN BE WAITED OUT
===============================================================================

Get-Volume on this host at gate time:

  DriveLetter FileSystemLabel DriveType SizeRemaining
  ----------- --------------- --------- -------------
                    Recovery      Fixed     404242432
  C                 Acer          Fixed  279541288960

No MERCHBACKUP volume. As previously written, this suite could not reach
green on ANY machine without a volume carrying that exact label - including
each of the three classmates' laptops. ADR-012 makes "a clean installation on
a fresh machine succeeds from the guide alone" the measure of whether this
deliverable exists at all, so a suite that is red by default on a fresh
machine was a handover defect waiting for Phase 6, not merely an
inconvenience today.

Attaching the USB would have turned this one run green and left the next
machine exactly as broken.
